  "solution": "Given:\n\n(0.6×0.6÷0.3+0.2×0.3-0.6)/(0.1×0.2÷0.4)\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n(0.6×0.6÷0.3+0.2×0.3-0.6)/(0.1×0.2÷0.4)\n\n⇒ (0.6×2+0.2×0.3-0.6)/(0.1×0.5)\n\n⇒ (1.2 +0.06-0.6)/(0.05)\n\n⇒ (0.66)/(0.05)\n\n⇒ 13.2\n\n∴ The simplified value is 13.2.",
